# .doctorignore — findings src/Tools/doctor.php should report but not fail on.
#
# One repo-relative path or glob per line. Blank lines and # comments ignored.
# Matching is case-insensitive and supports * and ? wildcards, e.g.
#
#   src/Modules/Legacy/*
#   src/Modules/*/Routes/Old*.php
#
# Entries here are still PRINTED under "Ignored" — they just do not affect the
# exit code, so CI stays green while the finding remains visible. Run
# `php src/Tools/doctor.php --strict` to ignore this file entirely.
#
# Only add something here once you have decided it is acceptable. An entry with
# no reason next to it is indistinguishable from a bug someone silenced.
#
# Currently empty: the one finding this file used to carry
# (src/Modules/Mail/Routes/MailRoutes.php) was fixed by deleting the dead route
# rather than suppressing it. Prefer that order — a suppression is a last
# resort, not a first one.
